    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Eighteen and over · From £680\",\"title\":\"Adult circumcision\",\"lede\":\"We provide adult circumcision for a wide range of reasons, including religious and cultural choice, personal preference and medical foreskin problems such as phimosis. We also assess men who are unhappy with a previous circumcision and want revision or re-circumcision.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Adult men\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The circumcision is carried out under local anaesthetic. You remain awake and can talk to the practitioner, watch videos or listen to music. We allow the anaesthetic time to work and check the area before the procedure begins.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For adults we commonly use the forceps-guided method with thermal cautery. Depending on the individual case, the wound may be closed with dissolvable stitches and/or skin glue.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"At a glance\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Anaesthetic\",\"v\":\"Local anaesthetic\"},{\"k\":\"During\",\"v\":\"Awake; talk, videos or music\"},{\"k\":\"Common method\",\"v\":\"Forceps-guided with thermal cautery\"},{\"k\":\"Closure\",\"v\":\"Dissolvable stitches and/or skin glue\"},{\"k\":\"Follow-up\",\"v\":\"Available during the healing period if needed\"},{\"k\":\"Price\",\"v\":\"£680, £880 or £1,080\"}],\"note\":\"From £680, or £880 with frenulum removal, or £1,080 with a medical or foreskin problem. See the u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/u0022 style=u0022color:var(u002du002dblue-deep)u0022u003efull price listu003c/au003e, broken down by age band.\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Before you come\",\"heading\":\"Preparation\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003culu003ern          u003cliu003eBring photo ID.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eBring close-fitting underwear such as tight V shaped briefs.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eShave clean the pubic area.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eBuy a 250ml tub of Vaseline.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eTell us in advance about medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems.u003c/liu003ern        u003c/ulu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Afterwards\",\"heading\":\"Work and normal activities\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003cpu003eMany patients with desk-based work can return to work immediately, while physically demanding work may require more time away (usually 2 weeks). We can provide a work letter where appropriate. Follow the individual activity restrictions given to you after your procedure.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Afterwards\",\"heading\":\"Aftercare\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003cpu003eBefore you leave, we explain the aftercare and give you written instructions. You can contact the clinic by telephone, WhatsApp or email if you have questions, and follow-up appointments are available during the healing period if needed. See the u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/u0022u003eaftercare pageu003c/au003e.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Medical circumcision\",\"heading\":\"Foreskin problems\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003cpu003eAdult circumcision may be recommended after assessment for conditions such as u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/u0022u003ephimosisu003c/au003e, recurrent u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/balanitis/u0022u003ebalanitisu003c/au003e, u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/bxo/u0022u003eBXO/lichen sclerosusu003c/au003e or other foreskin problems. We also assess u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/re-circumcision/u0022u003ere-circumcision or revisionu003c/au003e.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/figure {\"name\":\"certificates\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us first\",\"formId\":\"adults\",\"subject\":\"adult men enquiry\",\"urgent\":true} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Also at this clinic\",\"heading\":\"Circumcision at other ages\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"exclude\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/\",\"banded\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
